---
---

<section id="inicio" style="position:relative; overflow:hidden; background:#15110A; min-height:clamp(560px,86vh,880px); display:flex; align-items:center;">
  <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto"
         style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
    <source src="/assets/sbn-hero.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
  </video>
  <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1; background:linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(15,11,6,.86) 0%, rgba(15,11,6,.58) 46%, rgba(15,11,6,.22) 100%);"></div>
  <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1; background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(15,11,6,.55) 0%, transparent 32%);"></div>

  <div style="position:relative; z-index:2; width:100%; max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:clamp(56px,8vw,104px) 28px;">
    <div style="max-width:780px;">
      <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:13px; margin-bottom:26px;">
        <span style="width:36px; height:1px; background:#D9B24A;"></span>
        <span style="text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.24em; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:#EBDDB7;">Iglesia del Nazareno · Chile</span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:clamp(3rem,6.6vw,5.6rem); line-height:1.01; letter-spacing:-0.015em; margin:0; color:#FBF7F0;">
        Formando líderes para la <span style="font-style:italic; color:#E8C766;">misión del Reino</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:clamp(1.1rem,1.5vw,1.32rem); line-height:1.7; color:rgba(251,247,240,.88); max-width:33em; margin:30px 0 0;">
        Formación teológica integral, arraigada en la tradición Arminiana-wesleyana, para equipar a ministros y líderes comprometidos con el evangelio.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px; margin-top:40px;">
        <a href="#programas"
           style="text-decoration:none; background:#FBF7F0; color:#15110A; padding:16px 32px; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:.01em; transition:filter .2s;"
           onmouseover="this.style.filter='brightness(.93)'" onmouseout="this.style.filter=''">
          Ver programas académicos
        </a>
        <a href="#contacto"
           style="text-decoration:none; color:#FBF7F0; padding:16px 6px; font-size:16px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(251,247,240,.55); transition:border-color .2s;"
           onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='#E8C766'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='rgba(251,247,240,.55)'">
          Contáctanos →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Stats band -->
<section style="background:var(--bg); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding:clamp(32px,4.5vw,52px) 28px;">
  <div style="max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:32px;">
    <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-style:italic; font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2vw,1.7rem); line-height:1.3; color:var(--muted); margin:0; max-width:24em;">
      Rigor académico y fervor espiritual, al servicio de la iglesia local.
    </p>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:0 40px;">
      <div style="padding-right:40px; border-right:1px solid var(--line);">
        <div style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:2.6rem; line-height:1; color:var(--ink);">50<span style="color:var(--accent);">+</span></div>
        <div style="font-size:12.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.16em; color:var(--muted); margin-top:8px;">Años formando ministros</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:2.6rem; line-height:1; color:var(--ink);">2</div>
        <div style="font-size:12.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.16em; color:var(--muted); margin-top:8px;">Programas de grado</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
